    "methods_description": "MEG data were acquired across two sessions per participant. Participants performed a working memory task requiring maintenance and comparison of visual Gabor stimuli (varying in spatial frequency and orientation) following directional cues, and a one-back control task. Structural T1 MRI was acquired for anatomical reference. Head position indicator (HPI) coordinates were recorded in surface MRI space using neuronavigation (Brainsight). Behavioral responses and reaction times were recorded synchronously with MEG acquisition using event triggers.",
